{"id": "EUVD-2026-95918", "enisaUuid": "6f34bcd3-4b78-312b-9362-1c637f15effa", "description": "MariaDB server is a community developed fork of MySQL server. From 10.6.1 until 10.6.28, 10.11.19, 11.4.13, 11.8.9, 12.3.3, and 13.0.2, the mysql_json plugin assumed that imported MySQL tables contained valid MySQL binary JSON data. A specially prepared MySQL table containing invalid JSON data could cause out-of-bounds reads, information disclosure, or a server crash. This issue is fixed in versions 10.6.28, 10.11.19, 11.4.13, 11.8.9, 12.3.3, and 13.0.2.", "datePublished": "2026-10-09T17:22:19", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T17:04:02", "baseScore": 4.4, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:L/I:N/A:L", "references": ["https://github.com/MariaDB/server/security/advisories/GHSA-89ph-64cf-gqcc", "https://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/851f52470d470a96a66e0b7e5599f3b6c2e45907", "https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-10.11.19", "https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-10.6.28", "https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-11.4.13", "https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-11.8.9", "https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-12.3.3", "https://github.com/MariaDB/server/releases/tag/mariadb-13.0.2", "https://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-40678"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-107817"], "assigner": "GitHub_M", "epss": 0.14, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1b531f69-4ac5-3e0b-9062-38b6696cdf44", "product": {"name": "Server", "vendor": {"name": "Devolutions"}}, "product_version": "12.3.1, < 12.3.3"}, {"id": "5eea2878-cb74-368b-a766-4836a21b3f84", "product": {"name": "Server", "vendor": {"name": "Devolutions"}}, "product_version": "13.0.1, < 13.0.2"}, {"id": "647cba54-3b8e-377f-888b-7eb0e88dabfb", "product": {"name": "Server", "vendor": {"name": "Devolutions"}}, "product_version": "10.11.1, < 10.11.19"}, {"id": "65ce3614-4bc4-3bd6-a07f-b4c23106e983", "product": {"name": "Server", "vendor"